        {
          "text": "Ne buli mundu owalekha tsinzuS kata abasiani babwe, kata bambootsonyene, kata samwana, kata nyina, kata abaana, kata emikunda, khulwa eliira lianje, alanyoola okhuula eshikhumi, khandi alilia obulaame bwobulamu bwobumeli. ",
          "type": "text",
